  <h3>模型生成地点保底</h3>
  <p>确保最终推荐中至少有 1 个模型生成的地点（source 为 "generated"），防止本地地点全挤出：</p>
<pre><code>final = scored[:6]
has_generated = any(p.get("source") == "generated" for p in final)
if not has_generated and generated_places:
    best_gen = max(scored, key=lambda x: x["score"] if x.get("source")=="generated" else -1)
    if best_gen.get("source") == "generated":
        final.pop()
        final.append(best_gen)
        final.sort(key=lambda x: x["score"], reverse=True)</code></pre>
